  ┌─ Keys · lazyrunner v<version> ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ Run                                                           Ctrl+O      Jump back                    │
  │   Space       Start / stop the focused app                    Alt+→       Jump forward                 │
  │   u U         Start · focused / all                           f           Filter the focused column b… │
  │   s S         Stop · focused / all                            m           Mark a line                  │
  │   r R         Restart · focused / all                         [           Older mark                   │
  │   b B         Build · focused / all                           ]           Newer mark                   │
  │   q           Quit                                            '           Marks: every column's, to j… │
  │ Tools                                                         + -         Widen / narrow the focused … │
  │   d           Switch database                                 =           Equal column widths          │
  │   i           Install packages: npm ci or npm install         |           Layout: columns → next       │
  │   i c         npm ci                                          Ctrl+L      Clear output                 │
  │   i n         npm install                                     Ctrl+R      Reload window                │
  │   w W         Open in the browser · focused / all             t           Theme picker (Default)       │
  │   o           Open the focused app's log file               Help                                       │
  │   y           Copy (yank)                                     ,           Settings (on/off toggles, r… │
  │   D           Durations                                       ?           Key reference                │
  │   H           Requests: what the .NET apps served             :           Command palette              │
  │   M           Migrations: what's applied to the database    Navigate                                   │
  │   T           Tests: run the project's test suites            h l Tab     focus another column         │
  │   L           lazygit: git without leaving lazyrunner         1-5         jump to a column             │
  │   x           Menu for the focused app                        j k ↑ ↓     scroll a line                │
  │   F           Follow the agent                                ^u ^d ^b ^f half page / page (PgUp PgDn) │
  │ View                                                          gg G < >    oldest / follow new output   │
  │   /           Search the focused app's output                 n N Esc     search: older / newer / cle… │
  │   z           Zoom the focused column                                                                  │
  │ any key closes · : searches every command · lowercase = focused app, uppercase = all                   │
  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
